(7644089, 1242323, 123833, '<td valign="top">Those guys will suffer in old age, if they live that long.</td>', 'Those guys will suffer in old age, if they live that long.', '2019-10-21 01:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7644093, 1242324, 24642, '<td valign="top">Yey, a good yoga shot, I love yoga. The peacock pose is very physically demanding so that definetly meets the challenge. The pose is good and the model is in great shaphe. I like the strong  contrasting colors and the location. Good use of space although having the model face the opposite direction might have left a less busy spot for his head.</td>', 'Yey, a good yoga shot, I love yoga. The peacock pose is very physically demanding so that definetly meets the challenge. The pose is good and the model is in great shaphe. I like the strong  contrasting colors and the location. Good use of space although having the model face the opposite direction might have left a less busy spot for his head.', '2019-10-21 01:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7644094, 1242322, 24642, '<td valign="top">A good shallow focus on this determined portrait. The look ant the sweat tells all about the hard physical work. I do find the yellow color a bit too strong and distracting, It pulls my eyes away from the main subject, perhaps a slight tweak with the yellow color would create a better balance?</td>', 'A good shallow focus on this determined portrait. The look ant the sweat tells all about the hard physical work. I do find the yellow color a bit too strong and distracting, It pulls my eyes away from the main subject, perhaps a slight tweak with the yellow color would create a better balance?', '2019-10-21 01:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
