(7644749, 1242292, 141542, '<td valign="top">Just enough here to elevate this image to interesting.  I especially love the expression of one of the female truck worker in the 3rd window.  <br/> <br/>Perhaps an easy to miss detail, but the person reaching in to their pocketbook on far right is great.  There''s almost a perfect flow of "steps" in the purchase process depicted here.  Maybe that''s the source of the title?</td>', 'Just enough here to elevate this image to interesting.  I especially love the expression of one of the female truck worker in the 3rd window.   Perhaps an easy to miss detail, but the person reaching in to their pocketbook on far right is great.  There''s almost a perfect flow of "steps" in the purchase process depicted here.  Maybe that''s the source of the title?', '2019-10-27 21:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7644750, 1242306, 141542, '<td valign="top">I know it''s not about the sign.  But the photograph says otherwise.</td>', 'I know it''s not about the sign.  But the photograph says otherwise.', '2019-10-27 21:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
